{
 "format": 1,
 "description": "SPECS golden-output cases. Each case runs `specs <args>` in a fresh temporary working directory prepared by `setup` (circuits/ copied from the repo so that `.include circuits/...` resolves, and an empty traces/ dir because testbenches and the default trace file write to traces/<name>.vcd relative to the cwd). Optional keys: expect (documentation only: fail|crash), note, timeout (s), vcd_ignore_values (regexes on hierarchical VCD signal names that are not compared at all, only their declaration), ignore_files (globs), ignore_streams / unordered_streams ([stdout|stderr]: not compared / compared as a multiset of lines), rlimit_nofile (soft open-files limit of the specs process).",
 "defaults": {
  "timeout": 120,
  "setup": {
   "copy": [
    "circuits"
   ],
   "mkdir": [
    "traces"
   ]
  }
 },
 "gtest": {
  "timeout": 600
 },
